#let body = [
= Project Narrative

Affordable, open-source motion capture can make quantitative movement measurements accessible to more
rehabilitation researchers, including investigators working in clinical settings. This project will harmonize
existing FreeMoCap gait and balance data with shared terminology and the information needed to understand how
measurements were obtained. Incorporating that harmonization into a reusable FreeMoCap export will help
researchers prepare interpretable movement data for sharing and future use across studies.
]

